requirements period_of_months v1
description "A test material: the dates and claims of koyomi's example period_of_months.cal, named one by one. The source of the closed days is borrowed from the bank holidays the calendar file pins. Written for this material; it does not say how any rule is read"

role legal "Decides how the words of a rule are read"
role development "Writes and fixes koyomi's file"

source bank_holidays = koyomi "calendars/england_and_wales.cal" source bank_holidays

scope koyomi "period_of_months.cal" date

requirement first_day
  text "The day itself is not counted"
  in force 2026-10-01..
  owner legal
  decided 2026-10-03 by legal "The period starts on the day after the origin. Decided for this material"
  satisfied by koyomi "period_of_months.cal" date first_day
    reviewed 2026-10-04 by development sha256:29836b1424129486 -> sha256:f7fbde9442fad208
  not verified "That the first day is not counted is checked on koyomi doc's page, by reading the rule and its restatement side by side. This material has no claim that checks it"
    approved 2026-10-04 by legal sha256:29836b1424129486

requirement last_day
  text "A period of months ends on the day before the corresponding day of the last month, or on the last day of that month when it has no such day"
  in force 2026-10-01..
  owner legal
  decided 2026-10-03 by legal "The corresponding day is counted from the first day. Decided for this material"
  satisfied by koyomi "period_of_months.cal" date last_day
    reviewed 2026-10-04 by development sha256:534cb97e1ca8a94c -> sha256:e4d5741e15aeb403
  verified by koyomi "period_of_months.cal" claim last_day_after_origin
    reviewed 2026-10-04 by development sha256:534cb97e1ca8a94c -> sha256:d88a046cef583e8a

requirement last_day_moved
  text "An end that falls on a day closed in England and Wales moves to the day after"
  in force 2026-10-01..
  owner legal
  from @bank_holidays
    reviewed 2026-10-04 by legal sha256:538b3482c28b85ec -> sha256:edc4cc0bb4910f57
  decided 2026-10-03 by legal "The day after is taken as it is, and not moved on if it is closed too. Decided for this material"
  satisfied by koyomi "period_of_months.cal" date last_day_moved
    reviewed 2026-10-04 by development sha256:edc4cc0bb4910f57 -> sha256:da1536d15d1da2b6
  verified by koyomi "period_of_months.cal" claim moved_on_or_after_last_day
    reviewed 2026-10-04 by development sha256:edc4cc0bb4910f57 -> sha256:82aece4919f854bb
